{"message":"Great, let’s start by ensuring your phone is using the fastest network. Please set your network mode preference to 4g_5g_preferred by running:

set_network_mode_preference(mode="4g_5g_preferred")

Let me know once you’ve completed that, and we’ll move to the next step."}

{"message":"Next, please disconnect any active VPN connection by running:

disconnect_vpn()

Let me know once it’s done, and we’ll continue with the next step."}

{"message":"Please toggle your mobile data off and then back on by running:

toggle_data()

Let me know once you’ve done this."}

{"message":"Great! Now please toggle Data Saver mode off (or on if it’s currently off) by running:

toggle_data_saver_mode()

Let me know once that’s done, and we’ll proceed to the next step."}

{"message":"Your line has been refueled with 2 GB of additional data. This should help improve your speeds. Finally, to ensure roaming settings are correct on the network side, please toggle roaming on your device by running:

toggle_roaming()

Let me know once that’s done and we can verify your connection."}

{"message":"All set! Now let’s check your mobile data performance. Please run a speed test on your device by executing:

run_speed_test()

Share the results here, and we’ll confirm if you’re getting excellent speeds or need further adjustments."}

{"message":"Please grant the Messaging app access to storage on your phone. Use the action:

grant_app_permission(app_name="messaging", permission="storage")

Let me know once you’ve done that, and we’ll proceed to the next step."}

{"message":"Please reseat your SIM card now. Use the action:

reseat_sim_card()

Let me know once you’ve done that, and we’ll continue troubleshooting."}
